    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "REA Spratt offer for sale this attractive four-bedroom semi-detached home, ideally positioned in this much sought-after location. The property enjoys a most pleasant aspect overlooking Fr. Twomey??s Wood and benefits from a private driveway providing off-street parking, bordered by a lawned garden. A gated side entrance provides access to the walled-in, lawned rear garden, which also features a patio area, ideal for outdoor enjoyment and entertaining. The location of this home is particularly appealing, being within a short stroll of Dungarvan town centre and all the amenities it has to offer, including shops, schools, cafs, restaurants and leisure facilities. The property also enjoys easy access to the N25 and N72, providing excellent connectivity to Waterford, Cork and the surrounding areas, making this an ideal home for commuters. The bright spacious accommodation extends to approximately 114 sq.m and comprises an Entrance Porch, Inner Hallway, Living Room, Kitchen/Breakfast Area and Dining Room/Family Room, First Floor, 4 bedrooms, bathroom. REA Spratt highly recommend viewing to appreciate what this home has to offer. \n\nAccommodation\n\nEntrance Porch\n1.97m x 1.90m Glazed side panels, new flooring\n\nEntrance Hall\n3.45m x 1.89m Tiled flooring, carpet stairs\n\nSitting Room\n6.63m x 3.64m Feature marble fireplace, marble hearth, gas effect fire, dual aspect, timber flooring, built in unit\n\nKitchen\n4.69m x 2.83m Floor and eye level units, tiled floor and plashback, built in oven, extractor, plumbed for washing machine and dishwasher, new gas boiler\n\nDining Room/Family Room\n5.32m x 2.64m Carpet, aspect over front garden\n\nFirst Floor\n\n\nBedroom 1\n4.00m x 2.74m Built in wardrobes, timber effect flooring\n\nBedroom 2\n2.89m x 2.74m Built in wardrobes\n\nBedroom 3\n3.11m x 2.29m Built in Wardrobe, timber effect flooring\n\nBedroom 4\n3.37m x 2.62m Built in wardrobes, timber effect flooring\n\nBathroom\n2.46m x 1.67m Fully tiled, vanity unit, heated towel rail, Triton T90sr electric shower\n\n\nOutside\n-Lawned front garden with off street parking to the front -Enclosed rear garden"
      },
